WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.977
"Oh no!" cried Pig.

2
00:00:09.978 --> 00:00:13.554
"My kite is stuck in the tree!"

3
00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:19.307
"I will get it," said Bat.

4
00:00:19.308 --> 00:00:24.270
The wind blew too hard.

5
00:00:24.271 --> 00:00:30.069
Bat could not fly to the tree.

6
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:41.848
"I will get it," said Dog.

7
00:00:41.849 --> 00:00:47.543
Dog got the ladder.

8
00:00:47.544 --> 00:00:52.591
The wind blew harder.

9
00:00:52.592 --> 00:00:58.283
The ladder fell over.

10
00:00:58.284 --> 00:01:02.450
"I will get it," said Cat.

11
00:01:02.451 --> 00:01:05.986
Cat climbed up the tree.

12
00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:12.751
The wind shook the branches.

13
00:01:12.752 --> 00:01:17.188
Cat fell down.

14
00:01:17.189 --> 00:01:21.087
Cow looked at the kite.

15
00:01:21.088 --> 00:01:24.861
"I can't get it," said Cow.

16
00:01:24.862 --> 00:01:27.527
"It’s too high."

17
00:01:27.528 --> 00:01:32.128
"I miss my kite," said Pig.

18
00:01:32.129 --> 00:01:35.666
The wind blew very hard.

19
00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:38.327
The branches shook.

20
00:01:38.328 --> 00:01:41.548
The kite moved.

21
00:01:41.549 --> 00:01:44.404
The branches shook some more.

22
00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:51.664
The kite flew out of the tree!

23
00:01:51.665 --> 00:01:54.968
"Wow!" said everyone.

24
00:01:54.969 --> 00:02:03.455
"Yay!" said Pig.

25
00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:08.148
"Who wants a turn?"

